        <mxCell id="verdict" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;DECOMPOSABILITY VERDICT: SEMI-DECOMPOSABLE&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;• Interfaces (Swing frames) and application logic (SQL inside event handlers) are INSEPARABLE.&#xa;• The database service is the ONLY clean seam, reachable solely through Connect.java.&#xa;• Global static state (Pharmacy.username1 / today, Login.id / NAME) couples the frames.&#xa;• No service layer, no DAO layer, no domain model, no tests." vertex="1">
